sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as S11 workflow
  participant P1 as S10 authority
  participant P2 as Source owners
  participant P3 as Executor
  participant P4 as Provider
  participant P5 as S12 validation
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Request bound authorization
    P1->>P2: 2 Verify current owner receipts
    P1->>P0: 3 Reserve one exact attempt
    P3->>P1: 4 Revalidate permit and fence
    P3->>P3: 5 Retain dispatch intent
    P3->>P4: 6 Apply conditional provider action
    P0->>P5: 7 Reconcile effect and request probes
    P5->>P1: 8 Retain justified validation outcome
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P5: Denial stops dispatch. An uncertain provider effect stays Unknown. Only observed independent validation can establish recovery.
  end
